<title>USA: KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>KCBT deliverable HRW wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, MO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Kansas City Board of Trade reported stocks of hard red winter wheat in deliverable position in exchange approved warehouses as of Oct 25, in 000 bushels. Note: Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Oct 25  WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   KANSAS CITY AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 5,855    6,074 11,882</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     135	189    370</p>
<p>CCC stocks				    863	863  1,306</p>
<p>Total					 6,853    7,126 13,558</p>
<p>						    HUTCHINSON AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 2,378    4,102   unq</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     352	382   unq</p>
<p>CCC stocks				  3,583    2,384   unq</p>
<p>Total					 6,313    6,868   unq</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
